<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis (Mus musculus & Gallus gallus embryonic hindlimb and forelimb buds)",
        "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis faithfully reproduces Mus musculus & Gallus gallus embryonic hindlimb and forelimb buds morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus & Gallus gallus embryonic hindlimb and forelimb buds specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 54.6/100, audit 2026-10-19-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py> ;
    schema:about "Mus musculus & Gallus gallus embryonic hindlimb and forelimb buds" ;
