<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions correspond to IddU/BrdU proliferation source rates and limb bud contour evolution, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_017_limb_bud_elongation_pushing.lean` proves 3 theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Boehm et al. (2010) Eqs. 1-11 and Gros et al. (2010) Figs. 1-6." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py L29–L85: Baseline functions lack detailed equation-by-equation citations to Boehm et al. (2010) Eqs. 1-11 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py#L29-L85>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — Model fidelity to source: 66/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the IddU/BrdU cell-cycle source profile (`compute_brdu_iddu_source_rate`, L29-40) and a kinematic 2D boundary contour integration (`simulate_limb_bud_v1`, L43-85) comparing isotropic proliferation (`zeta_ocd=0, chi_fgf=0`) against directional pushing (`zeta_ocd=1, chi_fgf=1`). However, v1 omits the 2D/3D continuum artificial-compressibility Poisson pressure solver (Boehm et al. 2010 Eqs. 3-5, 10-11), omits the 5-regime perturbation suite (including the Wnt5a-/- PCP mutant, uniform-Tc control, and FGF-only motility regime), and omits the Hooke-Jeeves inverse-optimization demonstration showing why isotropic growth requires unphysical distal rates (`s > 0.50 h^-1`) and negative DV shrinkage." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py L43–L85: Kinematic 2D boundary update omitting full continuum Stokes/pressure-Poisson solver, Reynolds sweep, and Wnt5a-/- mutant regime <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py#L43-L85>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — Morphometric validation: 54/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 4 synthetic measurements in `measure_morphoeval()` (L163-171), but does not validate the 5-regime PD elongation and E11.5 aspect-ratio hierarchy against empirical benchmarks (Pearson r, RMSE), does not verify Reynolds-number insensitivity, and does not extract empirical `St0` vs `St1` contours or aspect ratios from `mouse_limb_bud_specimen.jpg`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py L163–L171: 4 synthetic metrics without specimen segmentation or 5-regime empirical correlation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py#L163-L171>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-distal-to-proximal-net-proliferation-source-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-model-i-isotropic-proliferation-6h-pd-elongation-vs-control>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-model-ii-directional-wnt5a-fgf8-pushing-6h-pd-elongation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-measurement-model-ii-final-pd-ap-aspect-ratio-after-6h> ;
