<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Boehm et al. (2010) & Gros et al. (2010) vertebrate limb bud oriented cell division & Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing vs proliferation-gradient hypothesis — MorphoEval overall 54.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py` (57.3/100). The v1 baseline simulates a 1D/2D boundary contour comparing Model I (isotropic proliferation gradient) against Model II (directional Wnt5a/FGF8 pushing), but omits a full 2D/3D continuum artificial-compressibility pressure-Poisson & Stokes velocity solver (`-nabla p + (1/Re)*nabla^2 v + nabla . sigma_active = 0`, `nabla . v = s(x)`), omits the 5-order-of-magnitude Reynolds number sensitivity sweep (`Re in [10^-6, 10^-1]`), omits the Wnt5a-/- bulbous mutant and Hooke-Jeeves inverse-optimization analysis, does not load or segment `mouse_limb_bud_specimen.jpg`, and exposes no CLI flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.6/100 (faithfulness 49.5, reproducibility 66.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 66, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 46, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/limb_bud_elongation_pushing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-boehm-limb-bud-elongation-pushing.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 119117 B, 1890×602 px, artifact_sha256 bd430e6fba9f2cdcaa8f288d9ecdad5104e827f3b0ec29fcbb53ee707c96bf45 (sha256 bd430e6fba9f2cdcaa8f288d9ecdad5104e827f3b0ec29fcbb53ee707c96bf45), spec_fingerprint 4c3f0cfc301e2c955c4f4f6c7d2e02e3996ca3b4cd571d212368d55baab36b29. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4c3f0cfc301e2c955c4f4f6c7d2e02e3996ca3b4cd571d212368d55baab36b29; artifact_sha256: bd430e6fba9f2cdcaa8f288d9ecdad5104e827f3b0ec29fcbb53ee707c96bf45." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement a 2D/3D continuum viscoelastic/Stokes limb bud growth solver with artificial-compressibility pressure-Poisson coupling (`nabla^2 p = (nabla . v - s(x))/(beta * dtau)`), comparing Model I (isotropic proliferation gradient), Model II (Wnt5a/JNK oriented cell division/intercalation active stress + AER-FGF8/MAPK chemotactic velocity field), Wnt5a-/- bulbous mutant, uniform-Tc control, and FGF-only motility across E11.0-E11.25 (6h) and E9.5-E11.5 (`L_PD/W_AP > 2.1`), plus the 5-decade Reynolds number sweep (`Re in [10^-6, 10^-1]`) and Hooke-Jeeves inverse-optimization demonstration.",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/limb_bud_elongation_pushing/limb_bud_elongation_pushing_reference.json` and `mouse_limb_bud_specimen.jpg`, segment the E11.0 (`St0`) and E11.25 (`St1`) OPT 3D iso-surfaces (Panels D, E), Dorsal/Posterior `St0`-in-`St1` overlays (Panel F), and 3D tetrahedral mesh (Panel G), and quantify empirical PD elongation and aspect-ratio changes.",
        "remediation needed: Validate the 5-regime PD elongation and E11.5 aspect-ratio hierarchy against Boehm et al. (2010) and Gros et al. (2010) empirical benchmarks (Pearson r, RMSE), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-anchored metrics, and expose full CLI flags." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.46e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

